{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: Wisdom 17 or Intelligence 17 or higher\n\nYou don’t like being manipulated or controlled, especially by magic. That’s why you’ve developed psychic countermeasures against anyone trying to mess with your mind or emotions. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- You have advantage on Wisdom and Intelligence saving throws. If another feature already granted you advantage on roll affected by this feature, you gain a bonus to it equal to your proficiency bonus, even if you already do.\n\n- Whenever you succeed on a Wisdom or Intelligence saving throw imposed by a creature, you deal Psychic damage equal to your level + your Wisdom or Intelligence modifier (your choice) to that creature.\n\n- You have resistance to Psychic damage","level":1}],"id":"Custom683e5ad7-4131-48ca-9cea-89245d9c11b3","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Deadly Mind [SM] [LG]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}